    "directions": [
      "Core the apple and cut it into 8 wedges. Put the apple wedges in a small nonreactive bowl and toss with 1 tablespoon of the lime juice.",
      "Just before serving, combine the cider, tequila, crème de cassis, and the remaining 5 tablespoons of lime juice in a pitcher with the 2 cups of ice. Stir well until all the ingredients are mixed. Pour the Chimayó Cocktail into ice-filled highball glasses. Press an apple wedge onto the rim of each glass for garnish and serve at once."
